ader align_center has_image\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzMwNDE3ODkyLnBuZw==/original/kOPO17.png\" alt=\"Risk of Ruin\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Risk of Ruin</h1></div><div itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Product\" itemscope id=\"view_html_game_2247016\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_5584746\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-width=\"640\" data-height=\"360\" class=\"game_frame start_maximized game_pending\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px\"><div class=\"restore_wrapper\"><button class=\"restore_btn button\"><svg height=\"24\" version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Restore game</button></div><div data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/19493255/index.html?v=1790808445&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg height=\"24\" version=\"1.1\" fill=\"none\" width=\"24\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" role=\"img\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a href=\"https://cachecarti.itch.io/risk-of-ruin/donate\" data-donate=\"true\" class=\"button donate_btn\">Support This Game</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><strong>A unique roguelike deck builder where your deck is REAL trading algorithms you can code. Trade and Evolve your Fund.&nbsp;<br><br><strong><em>Play like a real crypto trader trades, frantically check X/Twitter(In-game satirical X feed), fall for scams, troll others, lose 100k in a day, but most importantly, keep going!!</em></strong><br></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Every card is a real trading strategy. Every fight is a real backtest on real&nbsp;historical crypto data: the same bars, the same fills, the same fees.</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Nothing is faked, nothing is rigged, and the tape never lies.</strong></p>\r\n<ul><li><strong>\uD83C\uDCCF&nbsp;DRAFT a desk of 8 strategies from 9 archetypes: momentum, reversion,&nbsp;scalper, etc.</strong></li></ul>\r\n<ul><li><strong>⚔️ FIGHT ghost desks on real historical fights: chop, crashes, bull runs,&nbsp;liquidation cascades</strong></li></ul>\r\n<ul><li><strong>⚖️ PLAY DIRECTIVES turn by turn: leverage dials, hard stops, iceberg, 66 cards across 6 families</strong></li></ul>\r\n<ul><li><strong>\uD83D\uDCD6 READ THE CROWD: a live X-style feed of rival traders, some right,&nbsp;most wrong, all loud</strong></li></ul>\r\n<ul><li><strong>\uD83D\uDDFA️&nbsp;CLIMB the map: Garage Desk → Family Office → Hedge Fund → Big Desk,&nbsp;~6-8 real fights per act, bosses on real iconic&nbsp;crash moments</strong></li></ul>\r\n<ul><li><strong>⚒️&nbsp;FORGE your own trader: describe it, code it or use the inbuilt&nbsp;AI to write the code, it runs a&nbsp;real backtest, and a 7-stage validation gauntlet judges it. Pass and&nbsp;it becomes a card. Fail and it still fights, unranked.</strong></li></ul>\r\n<p><strong>THE DAILY CLIMB: one seeded run per day, same tape for everyone.<br><br></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Every strategy in the game is a real backtest. The ones you forge live&nbsp;on your desk for next runs.</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>Made by dMoERA: the real desk: <a href=\"https://dmoera.xyz\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">https://dmoera.xyz</a></strong></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" width=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_7387089\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Updated</td><td><abbr title=\"30 September 2026 @ 22:47 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 5 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Published</td><td><abbr title=\"29 September 2026 @ 00:54 UTC\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-stopwatch\"></span> 7 days ago</abbr></td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Rating</td><td><div data-tooltip=\"5.00 average rating from 2 total ratings\" itemprop=\"aggregateRating\" tabindex=\"0\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/AggregateRating\" itemscope class=\"aggregate_rating\"><div itemprop=\"ratingValue\" content=\"5.0\" class=\"star_value\"><span class=\"screenreader_only\">Rated 5.0 out of 5 stars</span><div style=\"width: 100.00000%\" class=\"star_fill\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"star 